WEBVTT

00:12:28.911 --> 00:12:30.871
from place to place,

00:12:30.913 --> 00:12:33.665
from workplace to the classroom ...

00:12:34.666 --> 00:12:37.836
beyond borders and beyond boundaries.

00:12:38.712 --> 00:12:40.172
And in this case ...

00:12:41.799 --> 00:12:45.302
skills and competencies
become the currency

00:12:45.302 --> 00:12:47.179
for a global workforce.

00:12:47.846 --> 00:12:49.807
And if we're able to do this ...

00:12:51.266 --> 00:12:54.895
I invite you to a graduation

00:12:54.937 --> 00:12:59.650
where we will have seen millions,
and possibly billions of students

00:12:59.691 --> 00:13:01.235
walk across that stage.